{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"747917198173143221","content":"There needs to be a story here that explains how the union of the old world and the new world resulted in the crazy levels of tech we have in empire.","created_at":"2020-08-27T22:13:15.034000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"748666465955348492","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"747917198173143221","content":"Idea: extreme leyline convergence in empire city. This is the cause of the high connections to the feywild in Ferrytown and the shadowfell in kingsbridge. But it also caused a portal to open to mechanus somewhere in the city. The connection to such as technology-based world allowed increased technological advancement. Unsure how exactly we'd work in the mechanus connection (where it is, etc) but that's my pitch","created_at":"2020-08-31T16:30:21.261000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"750029724759097488","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
