{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"justjack420","id":"592252026226999306","is_bot":0,"username":"justjack420"},"author_id":"592252026226999306","channel_id":"747917198173143221","content":"Maybe each of our player Factions have roots in the Knights, Mason's, or Order of Kairo.","created_at":"2020-08-31T16:37:10.531000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"750031441362157710","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"747917198173143221","content":"As i imagined it, things that were brought over, lots of artificers, the knowledge and tech that was the sub and other techs the new world didnt have.  if you take the maga magic that Arcania represents, and smash the magi-tech that was brought over, you would likely see a huge boom in progress over the 150 ish years that have passed.","created_at":"2020-08-31T16:50:51.617000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"750034885246320800","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
