{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Orxta","id":"343605682580488215","is_bot":0,"username":"robdor."},"author_id":"343605682580488215","channel_id":"747917198173143221","content":"Not sure where the best place to pitch this request would be, so here will work. I'm making a newspaper for the game, and would like to incorporate backstory and lore into that format. I'm looking for folks who want to write flavor pieces for the paper. These would be written as news articles. Could be opinion, advertisements, news stories, exposes, advise columns, classifieds, anything you might find in a newspaper. If interested, let me know and we can work out what kind of stories we need.","created_at":"2021-01-31T07:12:11.316000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"805334601185886238","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
