{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Orxta","id":"343605682580488215","is_bot":0,"username":"robdor."},"author_id":"343605682580488215","channel_id":"747917198173143221","content":"I think the best way to move forward with the Empire City Post is to do a mock-up example. What stories should the public know about? What backstory flavor elements can we use to play with format. If anyone has an article, please post it here, and I'll add it in. Or if someone has an NPC that's dead, we can do the obituary. If someone want's to promote your NPC business or shop, we can make ads for it. Any ideas?","created_at":"2021-03-30T06:20:01.158000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"826339968556204103","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
